        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The use of sick leave requires the approval of the dean or director, or designee. The dean or director, or designee, may request evidence of the illness, at their discretion. Sick leave shall not be used in advance of accrual. The qualifying event period in excess of a unit member's accrued sick leave shall be charged as leave without pay. Sick leave shall not be used during a holiday or a",
